<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Tribute Page - Swami Vivekananda</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff3e0, #ffe0b2);
        }

        /* Navigation Bar */
        .navbar {
            background-color: #e65100;
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .navbar a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 15px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .navbar a:hover {
            color: yellow;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            display: flex;
            margin: 20px;
        }

        /* Left Section */
        .left {
            width: 30%;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #ffe0b2;
            padding: 20px;
            border-right: 3px solid #e65100;
        }

        .left img {
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 4px solid #e65100;
        }

        /* Right Section */
        .right {
            width: 70%;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: white;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #e65100;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #bf360c;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #e65100;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <div class="navbar">
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Biography</a>
        <a href="#">Teachings</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Layout -->
    <div class="container">

        <!-- Left Side -->
        <div class="left">
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/Swami_Vivekananda.jpg" alt="Swami Vivekananda">
            <h2>Swami Vivekananda</h2>
            <p>Spiritual Leader</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Side -->
        <div class="right">
            <h1>About</h1>
            <p>
                Swami Vivekananda was a great Indian monk and philosopher who introduced
                Indian philosophies of Vedanta and Yoga to the Western world.
            </p>

            <h2>Achievements</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Speech at Chicago Parliament of Religions (1893)</li>
                <li>Founder of Ramakrishna Mission</li>
                <li>Inspired youth with his teachings</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Famous Quote</h2>
            <p><i>"Arise, awake, and stop not till the goal is reached."</i></p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
        <p>Profile Page using Internal CSS</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
